{"step_index":10549,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-26T13:36:12Z","thinking":"Creating the frontend `index.html` file, the plan is to implement a Windows 11 Fluent UI. This design involves using a modern Segoe UI font and adhering to dark mode styling with acrylic blur and rounded corners to replicate the look of a Windows 11 interface. The title bar will prominently display a \"This PC\" or \"My Computer\" icon to complete the design.\n\n\nFocus is now on designing the visual layout of a simulated Windows 11 File Explorer interface, mirroring its structural components. Identifying key elements such as the command ribbon, address bar with navigation controls, collapsible navigation pane, and main content pane. The goal is to represent \"This PC\" view with drive cards and file/folder representations.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no\">\n  <title>This PC - Windows 11 File Explorer (Azure VM)</title>\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Segoe+UI:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      --bg-base: #202020;\n      --bg-mica: rgba(32, 32, 32, 0.85);\n      --bg-surface: #2b2b2b;\n      --bg-sidebar: #1f1f1f;\n      --bg-header: #1c1c1c;\n      --bg-hover: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);\n      --bg-selected: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n      --border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n      --border-accent: #0078d4;\n      --text-main: #f3f3f3;\n      --text-muted: #a0a0a0;\n      --accent-blue: #60cdff;\n      --accent-fill: #005fb8;\n      --progress-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n      --radius-sm: 4px;\n      --radius-md: 8px;\n      --radius-lg: 12px;\n      --font-family: 'Segoe UI', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, sans-serif;\n    }\n\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n      user-select: none;\n      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      font-family: var(--font-family);\n      background: #0f0f14;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      height: 100vh;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    /* Window Container */\n    .win11-window {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      height: 100vh;\n      background: var(--bg-base);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);\n    }\n\n    /* Title Bar */\n    .title-bar {\n      height: 40px;\n      background: var(--bg-header);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 0 12px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    }\n\n    .title-left {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .my-computer-logo {\n      width: 22px;\n      height: 22px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      cursor: pointer;\n    }\n\n    .tab-bar {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 4px;\n      margin-left: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .win11-tab {\n      background: var(--bg-surface);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      border-bottom: none;\n      padding: 6px 14px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-md) var(--radius-md) 0 0;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      font-weight: 500;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .tab-close {\n      cursor: pointer;\n      opacity: 0.6;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      padding: 2px;\n    }\n    .tab-close:hover { opacity: 1; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); }\n\n    .title-controls {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n    }\n\n    .win-btn {\n      width: 44px;\n      height: 38px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      cursor: pointer;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      transition: background 0.15s;\n    }\n    .win-btn:hover { background: var(--bg-hover); color: #fff; }\n    .win-btn.close:hover { background: #e81123; color: #fff; }\n\n    /* Command Ribbon */\n    .command-ribbon {\n      height: 48px;\n      background: var(--bg-header);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      padding: 0 12px;\n      gap: 6px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      overflow-x: auto;\n    }\n\n    .ribbon-btn {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 6px;\n      padding: 6px 10px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n      font-size: 12px;\n      font-weight: 500;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      cursor: pointer;\n      border: 1px solid transparent;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .ribbon-btn:hover { background: var(--bg-hover); border-color: var(--border-color); }\n    .ribbon-btn svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; fill: currentColor; }\n\n    .ribbon-separator {\n      width: 1px;\n      height: 20px;\n      background: var(--border-color);\n      margin: 0 4px;\n    }\n\n    /* Address & Search Bar */\n    .address-bar-area {\n      height: 44px;\n      background: var(--bg-header);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      padding: 0 12px;\n      gap: 8px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    }\n\n    .nav-btn {\n      width: 32px;\n      height: 32px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      cursor: pointer;\n      background: transparent;\n      border: none;\n    }\n    .nav-btn:hover:not(:disabled) { background: var(--bg-hover); }\n    .nav-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.3; cursor: not-allowed; }\n    .nav-btn svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; fill: currentColor; }\n\n    .breadcrumbs-box {\n      flex: 1;\n      height: 32px;\n      background: var(--bg-surface);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      padding: 0 8px;\n      gap: 4px;\n      overflow-x: auto;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .breadcrumbs-box:focus-within { border-color: var(--accent-blue); }\n\n    .crumb-pill {\n      font-size: 12px;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      padding: 2px 6px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n      cursor: pointer;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 4px;\n    }\n    .crumb-pill:hover { background: var(--bg-hover); }\n    .crumb-arrow { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 10px; }\n\n    .search-box {\n      width: 240px;\n      height: 32px;\n      background: var(--bg-surface);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      padding: 0 10px;\n      gap: 6px;\n    }\n    .search-box:focus-within { border-color: var(--accent-blue); }\n    .search-input {\n      background: transparent;\n      border: none;\n      outline: none;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      font-size: 12px;\n      width: 100%;\n      font-family: inherit;\n    }\n    .search-input::placeholder { color: var(--text-muted); }\n\n    /* Main Workspace Body */\n    .workspace-body {\n      flex: 1;\n      display: flex;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n\n    /* Left Sidebar */\n    .sidebar {\n      width: 240px;\n      background: var(--bg-sidebar);\n      border-right: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      padding: 8px 6px;\n      overflow-y: auto;\n    }\n\n    .sidebar-section {\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .sidebar-title {\n      font-size: 11px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      padding: 6px 10px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    }\n\n    .sidebar-item {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 10px;\n      padding: 6px 10px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n      font-size: 12px;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: background 0.1s;\n    }\n    .sidebar-item:hover { background: var(--bg-hover); }\n    .sidebar-item.active { background: var(--bg-selected); font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent-blue); }\n    .sidebar-item svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; flex-shrink: 0; }\n\n    /* Content Area */\n    .content-area {\n      flex: 1;\n      background: var(--bg-base);\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      padding: 12px 16px;\n    }\n\n    /* This PC Drive Cards */\n    .drives-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));\n      gap: 14px;\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n\n    .drive-card {\n      background: var(--bg-surface);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n      padding: 12px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 14px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: all 0.15s;\n    }\n    .drive-card:hover {\n      background: var(--bg-hover);\n      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);\n      transform: translateY(-1px);\n    }\n\n    .drive-icon {\n      width: 44px;\n      height: 44px;\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n\n    .drive-details {\n      flex: 1;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 4px;\n    }\n\n    .drive-name {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n    }\n\n    .progress-bar-container {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 6px;\n      background: var(--progress-bg);\n      border-radius: 3px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    .progress-fill {\n      height: 100%;\n      background: var(--accent-blue);\n      border-radius: 3px;\n    }\n    .progress-fill.warning { background: #ffaa44; }\n    .progress-fill.danger { background: #ff4343; }\n\n    .drive-meta {\n      font-size: 11px;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n    }\n\n    /* Section Header */\n    .section-header {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n    }\n\n    /* File List Table (Details View) */\n    .files-container {\n      flex: 1;\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n      background: var(--bg-surface);\n    }\n\n    .files-table {\n      width: 100%;\n      border-collapse: collapse;\n      font-size: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .files-table th {\n      text-align: left;\n      padding: 8px 12px;\n      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      font-weight: 500;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      position: sticky;\n      top: 0;\n      z-index: 2;\n    }\n\n    .files-table tr {\n      cursor: pointer;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);\n      transition: background 0.1s;\n    }\n    .files-table tr:hover { background: var(--bg-hover); }\n    .files-table tr.selected { background: var(--bg-selected); }\n\n    .files-table td {\n      padding: 7px 12px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n    }\n\n    .col-name {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 10px;\n      font-weight: 500;\n    }\n\n    .file-icon {\n      width: 18px;\n      height: 18px;\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n\n    /* Grid View Option */\n    .files-grid-view {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(110px, 1fr));\n      gap: 12px;\n      padding: 14px;\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      flex: 1;\n    }\n\n    .grid-item {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center;\n      padding: 10px 6px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n      cursor: pointer;\n      text-align: center;\n      border: 1px solid transparent;\n      transition: all 0.12s;\n    }\n    .grid-item:hover { background: var(--bg-hover); border-color: var(--border-color); }\n    .grid-item.selected { background: var(--bg-selected); border-color: var(--accent-blue); }\n\n    .grid-item .file-icon {\n      width: 44px;\n      height: 44px;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .grid-item .item-title {\n      font-size: 11px;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      word-break: break-all;\n      display: -webkit-box;\n      -webkit-line-clamp: 2;\n      -webkit-box-orient: vertical;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      line-height: 1.3;\n    }\n\n    /* Status Bar */\n    .status-bar {\n      height: 26px;\n      background: var(--bg-header);\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 0 14px;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n    }\n\n    /* Notepad / Code Preview Modal */\n    .modal-overlay {\n      position: fixed;\n      top: 0;\n      left: 0;\n      right: 0;\n      bottom: 0;\n      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75);\n      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n      z-index: 1000;\n      display: none;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      padding: 20px;\n    }\n    .modal-overlay.active { display: flex; }\n\n    .win11-notepad {\n      width: 900px;\n      max-width: 95vw;\n      height: 600px;\n      max-height: 85vh;\n      background: #1e1e1e;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    .notepad-header {\n      height: 38px;\n      background: #252526;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 0 14px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    }\n\n    .notepad-title {\n      font-size: 12px;\n      font-weight: 500;\n      color: #fff;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .notepad-body {\n      flex: 1;\n      padding: 12px;\n      overflow: auto;\n      background: #181818;\n      font-family: 'Consolas', 'Courier New', monospace;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      line-height: 1.5;\n      color: #d4d4d4;\n      white-space: pre-wrap;\n      word-break: break-all;\n    }\n\n    .notepad-footer {\n      height: 36px;\n      background: #252526;\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 0 14px;\n    }\n\n    .btn-action {\n      background: var(--accent-fill);\n      color: #fff;\n      border: none;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n      padding: 5px 12px;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      font-weight: 500;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 6px;\n    }\n    .btn-action:hover { background: #0078d4; }\n\n    /* Mobile toggle */\n    .mobile-menu-btn {\n      display: none;\n      background: transparent;\n      border: none;\n      color: #fff;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      padding: 4px;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 768px) {\n      .sidebar {\n        position: absolute;\n        top: 0;\n        bottom: 0;\n        left: -260px;\n        z-index: 100;\n        transition: left 0.25s ease;\n      }\n      .sidebar.open { left: 0; }\n      .mobile-menu-btn { display: block; }\n      .search-box { width: 140px; }\n      .drives-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"win11-window\">\n  <!-- Title Bar -->\n  <div class=\"title-bar\">\n    <div class=\"title-left\">\n      <button class=\"mobile-menu-btn\" onclick=\"toggleSidebar()\" title=\"Toggle Sidebar\">\n        <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M3 18h18v-2H3v2zm0-5h18v-2H3v2zm0-7v2h18V6H3z\"/></svg>\n      </button>\n\n      <!-- My Computer Logo -->\n      <div class=\"my-computer-logo\" onclick=\"openThisPC()\" title=\"This PC / My Computer\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\">\n          <!-- Windows 11 Monitor / PC Icon -->\n          <rect x=\"4\" y=\"6\" width=\"40\" height=\"28\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#0078d4\"/>\n          <rect x=\"7\" y=\"9\" width=\"34\" height=\"22\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#1b1b1b\"/>\n          <path d=\"M12 14h10v10H12z\" fill=\"#00adf2\"/>\n          <path d=\"M26 14h10v10H26z\" fill=\"#0078d4\"/>\n          <path d=\"M18 34h12v4H18z\" fill=\"#808080\"/>\n          <path d=\"M14 38h20v3H14z\" fill=\"#a0a0a0\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"tab-bar\">\n        <div class=\"win11-tab\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#0078d4\"><path d=\"M1 2.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 2.5 1h3.707a1.5 1.5 0 0 1 1.06.44l1.293 1.293A.5.5 0 0 0 8.914 3H13.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 15 4.5v8a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.5h-11A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 1 12.5v-10z\"/></svg>\n          <span id=\"tabTitle\">This PC</span>\n          <span class=\"tab-close\">&times;</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"title-controls\">\n      <div class=\"win-btn\" title=\"Minimize\">&#8211;</div>\n      <div class=\"win-btn\" title=\"Maximize\">&#9633;</div>\n      <div class=\"win-btn close\" title=\"Close\">&times;</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Command Ribbon -->\n  <div class=\"command-ribbon\">\n    <div class=\"ribbon-btn\" onclick=\"openThisPC()\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 6h16v12H4z M2 4v16h20V4H2z\"/></svg>\n      <span>This PC</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ribbon-separator\"></div>\n    <div class=\"ribbon-btn\" onclick=\"refreshCurrent()\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M17.65 6.35A7.958 7.958 0 0 0 12 4c-4.42 0-7.99 3.58-7.99 8s3.57 8 7.99 8c3.73 0 6.84-2.55 7.73-6h-2.08A5.99 5.99 0 0 1 12 18c-3.31 0-6-2.69-6-6s2.69-6 6-6c1.66 0 3.14.69 4.22 1.78L13 11h7V4l-2.35 2.35z\"/></svg>\n      <span>Refresh</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ribbon-separator\"></div>\n    <div class=\"ribbon-btn\" onclick=\"toggleViewMode()\">\n      <svg id=\"viewModeIcon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 11h5V5H4v6zm0 7h5v-6H4v6zm6 0h5v-6h-5v6zm6 0h5v-6h-5v6zm-6-7h5V5h-5v6zm6-6v6h5V5h-5z\"/></svg>\n      <span id=\"viewModeText\">Grid View</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ribbon-separator\"></div>\n    <div class=\"ribbon-btn\" onclick=\"navigateTo('/home/azureuser/IrakIroan')\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#60cdff\"><path d=\"M10 4H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v12c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h16c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V8c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2h-8l-2-2z\"/></svg>\n      <span>IrakIroan Workspace</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ribbon-btn\" onclick=\"navigateTo('/home/azureuser/IrakIroan/Google_Drive_Backup/Extracted files/mdkamruzzamanirak_gmail_com')\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#a6e3a1\"><path d=\"M19.35 10.04C18.67 6.59 15.64 4 12 4 9.11 4 6.6 5.64 5.35 8.04 2.34 8.36 0 10.91 0 14c0 3.31 2.69 6 6 6h13c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5 0-2.64-2.05-4.78-4.65-4.96z\"/></svg>\n      <span>Google Drive Extracted</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Address & Search Bar -->\n  <div class=\"address-bar-area\">\n    <button class=\"nav-btn\" id=\"btnBack\" onclick=\"goBack()\" title=\"Back\" disabled>\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 11H7.83l5.59-5.59L12 4l-8 8 8 8 1.41-1.41L7.83 13H20v-2z\"/></svg>\n    </button>\n    <button class=\"nav-btn\" id=\"btnForward\" onclick=\"goForward()\" title=\"Forward\" disabled>\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 4l-1.41 1.41L16.17 11H4v2h12.17l-5.58 5.59L12 20l8-8z\"/></svg>\n    </button>\n    <button class=\"nav-btn\" id=\"btnUp\" onclick=\"goUp()\" title=\"Up to parent folder\" disabled>\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12l1.41 1.41L11 7.83V20h2V7.83l5.58 5.59L20 12l-8-8-8 8z\"/></svg>\n    </button>\n\n    <div class=\"breadcrumbs-box\" id=\"breadcrumbsBox\">\n      <!-- Breadcrumb pills inserted dynamically -->\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"search-box\">\n      <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#a0a0a0\"><path d=\"M15.5 14h-.79l-.28-.27A6.471 6.471 0 0 0 16 9.5 6.5 6.5 0 1 0 9.5 16c1.61 0 3.09-.59 4.23-1.57l.27.28v.79l5 4.99L20.49 19l-4.99-5zm-6 0C7.01 14 5 11.99 5 9.5S7.01 5 9.5 5 14 7.01 14 9.5 11.99 14 9.5 14z\"/></svg>\n      <input type=\"text\" class=\"search-input\" id=\"searchInput\" placeholder=\"Search current folder...\" onkeyup=\"handleSearch(event)\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Workspace Body -->\n  <div class=\"workspace-body\">\n    <!-- Left Navigation Sidebar -->\n    <div class=\"sidebar\" id=\"sidebar\">\n      <div class=\"sidebar-section\">\n        <div class=\"sidebar-title\">Quick Access</div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\" onclick=\"navigateTo('/home/azureuser')\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#60cdff\"><path d=\"M10 20v-6h4v6h5v-8h3L12 3 2 12h3v8z\"/></svg>\n          <span>Azure User Home</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\" onclick=\"navigateTo('/home/azureuser/IrakIroan')\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#f9e2af\"><path d=\"M10 4H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v12c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h16c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V8c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2h-8l-2-2z\"/></svg>\n          <span>IrakIroan Workspace</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\" onclick=\"navigateTo('/home/azureuser/GCP_FULL_BACKUP')\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#fab387\"><path d=\"M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z\"/></svg>\n          <span>GCP Backup Vault</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\" onclick=\"navigateTo('/home/azureuser/AGY-MASTER')\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#cba6f7\"><path d=\"M12 2L1 21h22L12 2zm0 3.5L19.5 19h-15L12 5.5z\"/></svg>\n          <span>AGY-MASTER Architecture</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"sidebar-section\">\n        <div class=\"sidebar-title\" style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;\">\n          <!-- My Computer Icon -->\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">\n            <rect x=\"4\" y=\"6\" width=\"40\" height=\"28\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#0078d4\"/>\n            <rect x=\"7\" y=\"9\" width=\"34\" height=\"22\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#1b1b1b\"/>\n            <path d=\"M18 34h12v4H18z\" fill=\"#808080\"/>\n            <path d=\"M14 38h20v3H14z\" fill=\"#a0a0a0\"/>\n          </svg>\n          <span>This PC</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\" onclick=\"navigateTo('/')\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#89b4fa\"><path d=\"M2 20h20v-4H2v4zm2-3h2v2H4v-2zM2 4v4h20V4H2zm4 3H4V5h2v2zm-4 7h20v-4H2v4zm2-3h2v2H4v-2z\"/></svg>\n          <span>Local Disk (C:)</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\" onclick=\"navigateTo('/home')\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#a6e3a1\"><path d=\"M2 20h20v-4H2v4zm2-3h2v2H4v-2zM2 4v4h20V4H2zm4 3H4V5h2v2zm-4 7h20v-4H2v4zm2-3h2v2H4v-2z\"/></svg>\n          <span>Data Disk (D:)</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"sidebar-section\">\n        <div class=\"sidebar-title\">Server Host</div>\n        <div class=\"sidebar-item\" style=\"cursor:default;\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#f38ba8\"><path d=\"M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-1 17.93c-3.95-.49-7-3.85-7-7.93 0-.62.08-1.21.21-1.79L9 15v1c0 1.1.9 2 2 2v1.93zm6.9-2.54c-.26-.81-1-1.39-1.9-1.39h-1v-3c0-.55-.45-1-1-1H8v-2h2c.55 0 1-.45 1-1V7h2c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2v-.41c2.93 1.19 5 4.06 5 7.41 0 2.08-.8 3.97-2.1 5.39z\"/></svg>\n          <span>Azure VM: FatehAli</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Area -->\n    <div class=\"content-area\">\n      <!-- Drives Container (Visible on \"This PC\") -->\n      <div id=\"drivesView\" style=\"display:none;\">\n        <div class=\"section-header\">\n          <span>Devices and Drives</span>\n          <span style=\"font-size:11px; color:var(--text-muted);\">Azure Virtual Machine FatehAli</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"drives-grid\" id=\"drivesList\">\n          <!-- Drive cards rendered here -->\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"section-header\" style=\"margin-top:20px;\">\n          <span>Quick Folders</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- File Details Table View -->\n      <div class=\"files-container\" id=\"detailsViewContainer\">\n        <table class=\"files-table\">\n          <thead>\n            <tr>\n              <th style=\"width:40%;\">Name</th>\n              <th style=\"width:25%;\">Date modified</th>\n              <th style=\"width:20%;\">Type</th>\n              <th style=\"width:15%; text-align:right;\">Size</th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody id=\"filesTableBody\">\n            <!-- Files rendered here -->\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- File Grid View -->\n      <div class=\"files-grid-view\" id=\"gridViewContainer\" style=\"display:none;\">\n        <!-- Grid items rendered here -->\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Status Bar -->\n  <div class=\"status-bar\">\n    <div id=\"statusLeft\">Loading...</div>\n    <div id=\"statusRight\">Microsoft Windows 11 · Azure Cloud VM</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Windows 11 Notepad / Preview Modal -->\n<div class=\"modal-overlay\" id=\"notepadModal\">\n  <div class=\"win11-notepad\">\n    <div class=\"notepad-header\">\n      <div class=\"notepad-title\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#60cdff\"><path d=\"M14 2H6c-1.1 0-1.99.9-1.99 2L4 20c0 1.1.89 2 1.99 2H18c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V8l-6-6zm2 16H8v-2h8v2zm0-4H8v-2h8v2zm-3-5V3.5L18.5 9H13z\"/></svg>\n        <span id=\"notepadFileName\">file.txt - Notepad</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"win-btn close\" onclick=\"closeNotepad()\">&times;</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"notepad-body\" id=\"notepadContent\"></div>\n    <div class=\"notepad-footer\">\n      <span id=\"notepadFileSize\" style=\"font-size:11px; color:#aaa;\">0 KB</span>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px;\">\n        <button class=\"btn-action\" onclick=\"copyNotepadContent()\">Copy Text</button>\n        <button class=\"btn-action\" id=\"btnDownloadFile\" style=\"background:#0078d4;\">Download File</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  let currentPath = \"/home/azureuser\";\n  let historyStack = [];\n  let historyIndex = -1;\n  let viewMode = \"details\"; // \"details\" or \"grid\"\n  let currentItems = [];\n\n  const icons = {\n    folder: `<svg class=\"file-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"#f9e2af\" d=\"M10 4H4c-1.1 0-1.99.9-1.99 2L2 18c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h16c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V8c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2h-8l-2-2z\"/></svg>`,\n    zip: `<svg class=\"file-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"#f38ba8\" d=\"M19.35 10.04C18.67 6.59 15.64 4 12 4 9.11 4 6.6 5.64 5.35 8.04 2.34 8.36 0 10.91 0 14c0 3.31 2.69 6 6 6h13c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5 0-2.64-2.05-4.78-4.65-4.96zM14 13h-3v3H9v-3H6v-2h3V8h2v3h3v2z\"/></svg>`,\n    code: `<svg class=\"file-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"#89b4fa\" d=\"M9.4 16.6L4.8 12l4.6-4.6L8 6l-6 6 6 6 1.4-1.4zm5.2 0l4.6-4.6-4.6-4.6L16 6l6 6-6 6-1.4-1.4z\"/></svg>`,\n    python: `<svg class=\"file-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"#fab387\" d=\"M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm1 17.93c-3.95-.49-7-3.85-7-7.93 0-.62.08-1.21.21-1.79L9 15v1c0 1.1.9 2 2 2v1.93z\"/></svg>`,\n    markdown: `<svg class=\"file-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"#cba6f7\" d=\"M14 2H6c-1.1 0-1.99.9-1.99 2L4 20c0 1.1.89 2 1.99 2H18c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V8l-6-6zm2 16H8v-2h8v2zm0-4H8v-2h8v2zm-3-5V3.5L18.5 9H13z\"/></svg>`,\n    database: `<svg class=\"file-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"#a6e3a1\" d=\"M12 2C6.48 2 2 4.02 2 6.5s4.48 4.5 10 4.5 10-2.02 10-4.5S17.52 2 12 2zm0 7c-4.41 0-8-1.34-8-2.5S7.59 4 12 4s8 1.34 8 2.5S16.41 9 12 9zm-8 4.5c0 1.16 3.59 2.5 8 2.5s8-1.34 8-2.5V11c-1.78 1.25-4.7 2-8 2s-6.22-.75-8-2v2.5zm0 5c0 1.16 3.59 2.5 8 2.5s8-1.34 8-2.5V16c-1.78 1.25-4.7 2-8 2s-6.22-.75-8-2v2.5z\"/></svg>`,\n    generic: `<svg class=\"file-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"#bac2de\" d=\"M6 2c-1.1 0-1.99.9-1.99 2L4 20c0 1.1.89 2 1.99 2H18c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V8l-6-6H6zm7 7V3.5L18.5 9H13z\"/></svg>`\n  };\n\n  function getIcon(item) {\n    if (item.is_dir) return icons.folder;\n    const ext = item.ext.toLowerCase();\n    if (['zip', 'tar', 'gz', 'bz2', 'xz', '7z', 'rar'].includes(ext)) return icons.zip;\n    if (['py'].includes(ext)) return icons.python;\n    if (['js', 'ts', 'jsx', 'tsx', 'rs', 'go', 'java', 'c', 'cpp', 'html', 'css', 'json', 'sh'].includes(ext)) return icons.code;\n    if (['md', 'txt', 'log'].includes(ext)) return icons.markdown;\n    if (['sql', 'db', 'sqlite', 'rdb'].includes(ext)) return icons.database;\n    return icons.generic;\n  }\n\n  async function loadDrives() {\n    try {\n      const res = await fetch('/api/drives');\n      const data = await res.json();\n      const container = document.getElementById('drivesList');\n      container.innerHTML = '';\n      data.drives.forEach(d => {\n        const card = document.createElement('div');\n        card.className = 'drive-card';\n        card.onclick = () => navigateTo(d.path);\n        \n        let barClass = 'progress-fill';\n        if (d.percent > 90) barClass += ' danger';\n        else if (d.percent > 75) barClass += ' warning';\n\n        card.innerHTML = `\n          <div class=\"drive-icon\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" width=\"44\" height=\"44\">\n              <rect x=\"6\" y=\"10\" width=\"36\" height=\"28\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#0078d4\"/>\n              <rect x=\"9\" y=\"13\" width=\"30\" height=\"22\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#202020\"/>\n              <path d=\"M12 30h24v2H12z\" fill=\"#00adf2\"/>\n              <circle cx=\"35\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#60cdff\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"drive-details\">\n            <div class=\"drive-name\">${d.label}</div>\n            <div class=\"progress-bar-container\">\n              <div class=\"${barClass}\" style=\"width: ${d.percent || 100}%;\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"drive-meta\">${d.free_str} free of ${d.total_str}</div>\n          </div>\n        `;\n        container.appendChild(card);\n      });\n    } catch (e) {\n      console.error(e);\n    }\n  }\n\n  async function navigateTo(targetPath, addToHistory = true) {\n    if (addToHistory) {\n      if (historyIndex < historyStack.length - 1) {\n        historyStack = historyStack.slice(0, historyIndex + 1);\n      }\n      historyStack.push(targetPath);\n      historyIndex = historyStack.length - 1;\n    }\n    updateNavButtons();\n\n    currentPath = targetPath;\n    document.getElementById('statusLeft').textContent = `Loading ${targetPath}...`;\n\n    const isThisPC = (targetPath === 'THIS_PC');\n    if (isThisPC) {\n      document.getElementById('drivesView').style.display = 'block';\n      document.getElementById('tabTitle').textContent = 'This PC';\n      document.getElementById('breadcrumbsBox').innerHTML = `<div class=\"crumb-pill\" onclick=\"openThisPC()\"><strong>This PC</strong></div>`;\n      await loadDrives();\n      targetPath = '/home/azureuser';\n    } else {\n      document.getElementById('drivesView').style.display = 'none';\n      document.getElementById('tabTitle').textContent = targetPath.split('/').pop() || 'Root';\n    }\n\n    try {\n      const res = await fetch(`/api/browse?path=${encodeURIComponent(targetPath)}`);\n      const data = await res.json();\n\n      if (data.error && !data.items) {\n        alert(\"Error: \" + data.error);\n        return;\n      }\n\n      currentItems = data.items || [];\n      renderBreadcrumbs(data.breadcrumbs || []);\n      renderFiles(currentItems);\n\n      document.getElementById('statusLeft').textContent = `${data.total_items || 0} items | Folders: ${data.total_folders || 0}, Files: ${data.total_files || 0} (${data.total_size_str || '0 B'})`;\n    } catch (err) {\n      document.getElementById('statusLeft').textContent = `Error loading folder`;\n      console.error(err);\n    }\n  }\n\n  function renderBreadcrumbs(crumbs) {\n    const box = document.getElementById('breadcrumbsBox');\n    box.innerHTML = '';\n    crumbs.forEach((c, idx) => {\n      const pill = document.createElement('div');\n      pill.className = 'crumb-pill';\n      pill.textContent = c.name;\n      pill.onclick = () => navigateTo(c.path);\n      box.appendChild(pill);\n\n      if (idx < crumbs.length - 1) {\n        const arrow = document.createElement('span');\n        arrow.className = 'crumb-arrow';\n        arrow.innerHTML = '&#9656;';\n        box.appendChild(arrow);\n      }\n    });\n  }\n\n  function renderFiles(items) {\n    const tableBody = document.getElementById('filesTableBody');\n    const gridView = document.getElementById('gridViewContainer');\n    tableBody.innerHTML = '';\n    gridView.innerHTML = '';\n\n    if (!items || items.length === 0) {\n      tableBody.innerHTML = `<tr><td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center; padding:20px; color:#888;\">This folder is empty.</td></tr>`;\n      gridView.innerHTML = `<div style=\"grid-column:1/-1; text-align:center; padding:40px; color:#888;\">This folder is empty.</div>`;\n      return;\n    }\n\n    items.forEach(item => {\n      // Details view row\n      const tr = document.createElement('tr');\n      tr.onclick = (e) => handleItemClick(item, e);\n      tr.ondblclick = () => handleItemOpen(item);\n      tr.innerHTML = `\n        <td>\n          <div class=\"col-name\">\n            ${getIcon(item)}\n            <span>${item.name}</span>\n          </div>\n        </td>\n        <td>${item.mtime_str || '-'}</td>\n        <td>${item.type_name || '-'}</td>\n        <td style=\"text-align:right;\">${item.size_str || ''}</td>\n      `;\n      tableBody.appendChild(tr);\n\n      // Grid view card\n      const card = document.createElement('div');\n      card.className = 'grid-item';\n      card.onclick = (e) => handleItemClick(item, e);\n      card.ondblclick = () => handleItemOpen(item);\n      card.innerHTML = `\n        ${getIcon(item)}\n        <div class=\"item-title\" title=\"${item.name}\">${item.name}</div>\n      `;\n      gridView.appendChild(card);\n    });\n  }\n\n  function handleItemClick(item, e) {\n    document.querySelectorAll('.files-table tr, .grid-item').forEach(el => el.classList.remove('selected'));\n    if (e.currentTarget) e.currentTarget.classList.add('selected');\n    document.getElementById('statusLeft').textContent = `Selected: ${item.name} (${item.size_str || 'Folder'})`;\n  }\n\n  function handleItemOpen(item) {\n    if (item.is_dir) {\n      navigateTo(item.path);\n    } else {\n      openFilePreview(item.path, item.name);\n    }\n  }\n\n  async function openFilePreview(filePath, fileName) {\n    const modal = document.getElementById('notepadModal');\n    const title = document.getElementById('notepadFileName');\n    const content = document.getElementById('notepadContent');\n    const size = document.getElementById('notepadFileSize');\n    const downloadBtn = document.getElementById('btnDownloadFile');\n\n    title.textContent = `${fileName} - Notepad`;\n    content.textContent = 'Loading file preview...';\n    modal.classList.add('active');\n\n    downloadBtn.onclick = () => {\n      window.open(`/api/raw?path=${encodeURIComponent(filePath)}&download=1`, '_blank');\n    };\n\n    try {\n      const res = await fetch(`/api/content?path=${encodeURIComponent(filePath)}`);\n      const data = await res.json();\n      if (data.error) {\n        content.textContent = \"Error: \" + data.error;\n      } else {\n        content.textContent = data.content;\n        size.textContent = data.size_str;\n      }\n    } catch (e) {\n      content.textContent = \"Failed to load content: \" + e;\n    }\n  }\n\n  function closeNotepad() {\n    document.getElementById('notepadModal').classList.remove('active');\n  }\n\n  function copyNotepadContent() {\n    const text = document.getElementById('notepadContent').textContent;\n    navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(() => {\n      alert(\"File content copied to clipboard!\");\n    });\n  }\n\n  function openThisPC() {\n    navigateTo('THIS_PC');\n  }\n\n  function toggleViewMode() {\n    const detailsContainer = document.getElementById('detailsViewContainer');\n    const gridContainer = document.getElementById('gridViewContainer');\n    const text = document.getElementById('viewModeText');\n\n    if (viewMode === 'details') {\n      viewMode = 'grid';\n      detailsContainer.style.display = 'none';\n      gridContainer.style.display = 'grid';\n      text.textContent = 'Details View';\n    } else {\n      viewMode = 'details';\n      detailsContainer.style.display = 'block';\n      gridContainer.style.display = 'none';\n      text.textContent = 'Grid View';\n    }\n  }\n\n  function refreshCurrent() {\n    navigateTo(currentPath, false);\n  }\n\n  function goBack() {\n    if (historyIndex > 0) {\n      historyIndex--;\n      navigateTo(historyStack[historyIndex], false);\n      updateNavButtons();\n    }\n  }\n\n  function goForward() {\n    if (historyIndex < historyStack.length - 1) {\n      historyIndex++;\n      navigateTo(historyStack[historyIndex], false);\n      updateNavButtons();\n    }\n  }\n\n  function goUp() {\n    if (currentPath === '/' || currentPath === 'THIS_PC') return;\n    const parts = currentPath.split('/').filter(Boolean);\n    parts.pop();\n    const parent = parts.length === 0 ? '/' : '/' + parts.join('/');\n    navigateTo(parent);\n  }\n\n  function updateNavButtons() {\n    document.getElementById('btnBack').disabled = (historyIndex <= 0);\n    document.getElementById('btnForward').disabled = (historyIndex >= historyStack.length - 1);\n    document.getElementById('btnUp').disabled = (currentPath === '/' || currentPath === 'THIS_PC');\n  }\n\n  function toggleSidebar() {\n    document.getElementById('sidebar').classList.toggle('open');\n  }\n\n  function handleSearch(e) {\n    const query = e.target.value.toLowerCase().trim();\n    if (!query) {\n      renderFiles(currentItems);\n      return;\n    }\n    const filtered = currentItems.filter(x => x.name.toLowerCase().includes(query));\n    renderFiles(filtered);\n  }\n\n  // Initial Load\n  window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n    openThisPC();\n  });\n</script>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Created Windows 11 File Explorer frontend application","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"/home/azureuser/IrakIroan/azure_file_explorer/static/index.html","toolAction":"Writing index.html","toolSummary":"Write index.html"}}]}
